    <data key="d1">[{"content": "客户流失预测：合成订阅业务说明 v1\n\n本材料由 AlgoFactory 项目编写，用于可公开提交的模拟业务演示，不包含真实客户资料。任务是监督式表格二分类，目标字段 churn 表示客户是否流失。任务最多比较 2 个候选，每个候选最多修复 2 次；执行预算为 Docker、120 秒、2 CPU、4096 MiB，禁网，缺少隔离环境时拒绝执行。\n\n客户流失预测能力接收客户表格特征和训练标签，输出流失类别和流失概率。输入字段包括 tenure_months（数值，允许缺失）、monthly_fee（数值，允许缺失）、support_tickets（数值）和 contract_type（类别，允许缺失）。churn 是标签，不得放入特征。适用条件是有监督标签的表格二分类；数值缺失填补、类别缺失填补及类别编码均只在训练集拟合。评价指标为 F1、ROC-AUC、Precision、Recall；具体通过阈值须经基线校准后冻结，本材料不提供模型成绩或通过阈值。\n\nLogistic Regression 属于线性分类模型，可以实现客户流失预测能力，适用于上述客户流失二分类任务。使用前需要填补数值和类别缺失、编码类别特征，并缩放数值特征。\n\nRandom Forest 属于树集成分类模型，可以实现客户流失预测能力，适用于上述客户流失二分类任务。为统一输入接口，使用前填补数值和类别缺失并编码类别特征，通常不要求数值缩放。\n\nHistGradientBoosting 属于梯度提升分类模型，可以实现客户流失预测能力，适用于上述客户流失二分类任务。本项目先使用数值和类别缺失填补、类别编码的统一预处理，并控制编码后特征规模。\n\n实现环境计划使用 scikit-learn，版本约束 &gt;=1.5,&lt;2。以上候选仅是待验证算法知识，尚未产生实现版本、验证记录、失败经验或已证实的修复结果。\n", "id": "source:ae8aa246325a083652ad97b25b61c4797ec4e5d66e7e1393c17e68a3ef63136a", "schema_version": 1, "sha256": "ae8aa246325a083652ad97b25b61c4797ec4e5d66e7e1393c17e68a3ef63136a", "title": "customer_churn.txt"}, {"content": "{\"candidate\":{\"attempt\":0,\"code_hash\":\"55e841b65763c76114bafc9c69b302bbe4d407f4030b10214407a283078bdd3f\",\"implementation_id\":\"workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6:candidate\",\"parent_id\":null,\"plan_id\":\"workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6:plan\",\"schema_version\":1},\"code_hash\":\"55e841b65763c76114bafc9c69b302bbe4d407f4030b10214407a283078bdd3f\",\"evaluation_scope\":\"validation_and_final_test\",\"execution_evidence\":[\"/Users/northchar/Documents/Codex/AlgoFactory/runtime/phase6-cold-start-4/checkout/runtime/phase6-acceptance/churn/validation-execution/execution.json\",\"/Users/northchar/Documents/Codex/AlgoFactory/runtime/phase6-cold-start-4/checkout/runtime/phase6-acceptance/churn/test-execution/execution.json\"],\"experience_usage\":{\"enabled\":false,\"excluded\":[],\"interpretation\":\"Delivery and model-declared use are traceable; causality requires controlled comparison.\",\"matches\":[],\"model_decisions\":[],\"observed_rule_satisfied\":false},\"plan\":{\"algorithm_id\":\"source:ae8aa246325a083652ad97b25b61c4797ec4e5d66e7e1393c17e68a3ef63136a:algorithm:logistic_regression\",\"dependencies\":[\"scikit-learn\"],\"evidence_ids\":[\"source:ae8aa246325a083652ad97b25b61c4797ec4e5d66e7e1393c17e68a3ef63136a:algorithm:logistic_regression\",\"source:ae8aa246325a083652ad97b25b61c4797ec4e5d66e7e1393c17e68a3ef63136a:capability:churn\"],\"plan_id\":\"workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6:plan\",\"preprocessing\":[\"median_imputation\",\"most_frequent_imputation\",\"one_hot_encoding\",\"standard_scaling\"],\"schema_version\":1,\"task_id\":\"workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6:task\"},\"search_summary\":null,\"status\":\"accepted\",\"task\":{\"class_labels\":[0,1],\"constraints\":{\"allowed_algorithms\":[],\"candidate_limit\":1,\"execution\":{\"backend\":\"docker\",\"cpus\":2,\"fail_closed\":true,\"memory_mib\":4096,\"network\":false,\"schema_version\":1,\"timeout_seconds\":120},\"max_repairs_per_candidate\":0,\"schema_version\":1},\"data_fingerprint\":\"3c6161603386e4e7921699b51a06caff3ef1bcf9fa4a14806ef006b0f721caff\",\"description\":\"根据客户特征预测客户是否流失，输出流失类别和概率。\",\"feature_schema\":[{\"dtype\":\"numeric\",\"name\":\"tenure_months\",\"nullable\":true,\"schema_version\":1},{\"dtype\":\"numeric\",\"name\":\"monthly_fee\",\"nullable\":true,\"schema_version\":1},{\"dtype\":\"numeric\",\"name\":\"support_tickets\",\"nullable\":false,\"schema_version\":1},{\"dtype\":\"categorical\",\"name\":\"contract_type\",\"nullable\":true,\"schema_version\":1}],\"metrics\":[{\"direction\":\"maximize\",\"name\":\"f1\",\"schema_version\":1,\"threshold\":0.59},{\"direction\":\"maximize\",\"name\":\"roc_auc\",\"schema_version\":1,\"threshold\":0.75},{\"direction\":\"maximize\",\"name\":\"precision\",\"schema_version\":1,\"threshold\":0.64},{\"direction\":\"maximize\",\"name\":\"recall\",\"schema_version\":1,\"threshold\":0.55}],\"schema_version\":1,\"seed\":42,\"split_id\":\"split:bcadf9303a79e6ed36975d7f6e0044e5c0d93386438b1430a7cdf1709f78b48b\",\"target\":\"churn\",\"task_id\":\"workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6:task\",\"task_type\":\"binary_classification\"},\"validation\":{\"code_hash\":\"55e841b65763c76114bafc9c69b302bbe4d407f4030b10214407a283078bdd3f\",\"config_hash\":\"dac9c9fc6f8821be4b2cab039f0aff13eab27114f265e36abd7e2b71d687c0a1\",\"error_category\":null,\"final_test_evaluated\":true,\"functional\":{\"details\":\"真实 fit/predict，长度、顺序和有限数值校验通过\",\"schema_version\":1,\"status\":\"passed\"},\"implementation_id\":\"workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6:candidate\",\"interface\":{\"details\":\"build_pipeline / fit / predict / predict_proba\",\"schema_version\":1,\"status\":\"passed\"},\"metrics\":{\"details\":\"验证集及一次性独立测试均达到冻结门槛\",\"schema_version\":1,\"status\":\"passed\"},\"report_paths\":[\"/Users/northchar/Documents/Codex/AlgoFactory/runtime/phase6-cold-start-4/checkout/runtime/phase6-acceptance/churn/report.json\",\"/Users/northchar/Documents/Codex/AlgoFactory/runtime/phase6-cold-start-4/checkout/runtime/phase6-acceptance/churn/report.md\"],\"resources\":{\"elapsed_seconds\":0.6477537919998895,\"peak_memory_mib\":158.73046875,\"schema_version\":1},\"run_id\":\"workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6:validation\",\"schema_version\":1,\"split_id\":\"split:bcadf9303a79e6ed36975d7f6e0044e5c0d93386438b1430a7cdf1709f78b48b\",\"stability\":{\"details\":\"{\\\"seed_repeat\\\": true, \\\"missing_column_rejected\\\": true, \\\"invalid_numeric_rejected\\\": true, \\\"unseen_category_handled\\\": true}\",\"schema_version\":1,\"status\":\"passed\"},\"status\":\"passed\",\"test_metrics\":{\"f1\":0.6666666666666666,\"precision\":0.7608695652173914,\"recall\":0.5932203389830508,\"roc_auc\":0.8162600111752655},\"validation_metrics\":{\"f1\":0.6457399103139013,\"precision\":0.6923076923076923,\"recall\":0.6050420168067226,\"roc_auc\":0.8004549886252843}},\"workflow_id\":\"workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6\"}", "id": "source:eb4e68d8b2f3b75cb7205834ffa6950902bc051240789eb58d860a699c6fb0a8", "schema_version": 1, "sha256": "eb4e68d8b2f3b75cb7205834ffa6950902bc051240789eb58d860a699c6fb0a8", "title": "workflow:aabc5f7f4c354488a0fab998ab28aaa6.json"}]</data>
